usage: aiopsctl trust add <public key file> [--ids <pattern>[,...]] [--runtimes <runtime>[,...]] [--signed <key or hook>[,...]] [--distribution]

Trust a public key: for the plugins that --ids names, or with --distribution as a root of distributions.

Flags:
  --ids <pattern>[,...]         the plugin ids the key signs: exact ids or <owner>/*
  --runtimes <runtime>[,...]    the runtimes the key signs, inproc or remote; none for packs only
  --signed <key or hook>[,...]  the signed keys and hooks the key may serve
  --distribution                trust the key as a root of distributions instead

Exit codes:
  0  success, or help that was asked for
  1  a denial, a failed step, rebuild-required, an interrupt or a failed boot; the reason is on stderr
  2  a usage error; a Go panic outside every fiber also exits 2, with the trace of the runtime
